      <data key="d7">L1_feature_12_histologic_diagnosis</data>
      <data key="d8">Invasive ductal carcinoma and atypical lobular hyperplasia (ALH). The invasive carcinoma is moderately differentiated, i.e., grade 2; 3+2+1, displays lobular features</data>
      <data key="d9">1.0</data>
      <data key="d10" />
