ION: 1. Queried left breast focal asymmetry with questioned associated architectural distortion for which diagnostic left mammogram and possible targeted diagnostic left breast ultrasound are recommended. 2. No [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED]. ASSESSMENT: BI-RADS mammogram: 0: Incomplete: Needs Additional Imaging Evaluation RECOMMENDATION: Recommendation: Diagnostic Mammogram, Recall Side: Left Follow-Up: Prompt follow up Recommendation 2: Diagnostic Ultrasound, Recall #2 (Side): Left #2 (Follow-Up): Prompt follow up https://www.myconnectnyc.org/mychart/app/test-results/details?pageMode=1[REDACTED] 1/2 Day, Ursula (MR # 39095007) Printed by Solange Bayard, MD [REDACTED] at [REDACTED] 12:41 PM 1/3 [REDACTED] 12:41 PM Day, Ursula (MR # 39095007) [REDACTED] 5:10 PM Connect - Test Details COMMENTS: A reminder letter will be sent to the patient [REDACTED] a [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] for the next mammogram. Our imaging experts are available to speak with patients and medical practitioners who have questions regarding breast radiology exams and results. To schedule a consultation, please contact the Radiology Consultation Services at 646-962-CARE (2273) or [REDACTED] Electronically Signed By: Emily Babiss on August 15, 2025 02:07 PM Scans on Order 939598287 Scan on [REDACTED] 5:06 PM by Chang, Nicole: MRS Scan on [REDACTED] 5:14 PM by Reed Dr La Cruz, Kimberly: mammo tech Result History Mammogram Screening Digital with Tomosynthesis - Bilateral (Order #939598287) on [REDACTED] Order Result History Report Images 📷 Scan 1 📷 Scan 2 https://www.myconnectnyc.org/mychart/app/test-results/details?pageMode=1[REDACTED] 2/2 Document Information Misc Administration: Outside Radiology, Breast MAMMO Day, Ursula (MR # 39095007) Printed by Solange Bayard, MD [REDACTED] at [REDACTED] 12:41 PM 2/3 [REDACTED] 12:41 PM Day, Ursula (MR # 39095007) [REDACTED] 00:00 Attached To: OUTSIDE OTHER ORDERS [REDACTED] Orders Only on [REDACTED] with Hi