      <data key="d13">Greenville, SC [REDACTED] Resulting Labs GMH PRISMA HEALTH GREENVILLE MEMORIAL HOSPITAL LABORATORY, 701 Grove Rd., GREENVILLE SC [REDACTED] [REDACTED] Page: 2 of 2 Printed: [REDACTED] 9:26 AM [DOCUMENT: Path_biopsy2.pdf] [REDACTED] 10:45 PM Weaver, Rachel Victoria (MR # 39091629) Media Information PATHOLOGY 8 Memorial Medical Court CONSULTANTS Phone: (864) 295-3492 Greenville, SC [REDACTED] specialized diagnostic services Fax: (864) 455-8926 IHC Prognostic Report Patient [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] Weaver, Rachel M[REDACTED]77 [REDACTED] C00499 WHC25-012873 Gender Female Collected 09/02/2025 Greenville Memorial MRN 974684034 Received 09/03/2025 Ordering Husman, MD, Abbie L. Body Site Right breast, 2:00, 3 cm from Phone [REDACTED] Fax 864-455-8926 nipple, 6 cm mass, coil clip, Treating Shah, MD, Pavani Thotakura ultrasound-guided core biopsy Specimen of breast tissue Clinical Information: Malignant neoplasm of unspecified site of unspecified female breast. Unspecified lump in the right breast, unspecified quadrant. Invasive carcinoma of no [REDACTED] of female breast. Cold Ischemia: &lt;1min Fixation Time: 12-14hrs [THIS IS IMAGE: H&amp;E stained tissue sample showing cellular structure] H&amp;E [THIS IS IMAGE: ER (SP1) stained tissue sample] Overall Result: Positive ER (SP1) Reference Range % Positive 96.7 &lt; 1% Negative Staining Intensity 2 1-10% Low Positive Analysis Image &gt;10% Positive Assay Type IVD ER (SP1) Clone SP1 [THIS IS IMAGE: PR (1E2) stained tissue sample] Overall Result: Positive PR (1E2) Reference Range % Positive 85.4 &lt; 1% Negative Staining Intensity 3 &gt;= 1% Positive Analysis Image Assay Type IVD PR (1E2) Clone 1E2 The IHC markers provided are intended for informational purposes only and should not be widely relied upon for taking judgments. Other digital images are used for evaluation. The Allred, H Score/Quickscore immunostains use utilized along with FOLDX. Pathologist reviews tissue/slide for determination of