NG RECOMMENDED: None IMPRESSION: Newly diagnosed right breast cancer with associated stoplight biopsy marker 1 cm laterally displaced. Appropriate action is recommended pending MSK pathology review. Wirth, Susan A [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] 8:55 AM 3/4 [REDACTED] 8:55 AM Wirth, Susan A [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] No [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] Electronically Signed By: MOLLY P. HOGAN MD on [REDACTED] 5:35 PM Exam Ended: [REDACTED] 15:37 Last Resulted: [REDACTED] 17:35 📄 Order Details 🔗 View Encounter 🧪 Lab and Collection Details 📧 Routing 📈 Result History Result Care Coordination 📞 Patient [REDACTED] 📧 Released ⚠️ Not seen Study Details Open Study Details Wirth, Susan A [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] 8:55 AM 4/4 [DOCUMENT: Path_biopsy.pdf] 8:52 AM Wirth, Susan A (MR # 39100822) Media Information O [REDACTED] 9:46 AM Fax Services [REDACTED] pg 7 of 34 10/6/25, 2:25 PM Atlantic Medical Imaging - Synapse EIS [LOGO: Atlantic Medical Imaging logo with text "Accurate answers. Fast."] 44 East Jimmie Leeds Road, Galloway, NJ [REDACTED] • P: [REDACTED] • F: [REDACTED] Name: [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] MRN: 930411541 Address: 599 SHORE RD STE 101 DOB: [REDACTED] [REDACTED]</data>
