LE HILL MINGKE WANG MD SITE PHONE: (718) 282-7000 139 CENTRE ST, STE PH102 NEW YORK NY [REDACTED] Patient: [REDACTED] Date of Birth: [REDACTED] Phone: (917) 674-5280 Date of Exam: [REDACTED] Addendum 1 - [REDACTED] BREAST SURGICAL PATHOLOGY ADDENDUM: Left breast 1 o'clock axis calcifications, core biopsy: -Ductal carcinoma in situ, intermediate to high nuclear grade, solid increased perforated patterns with necrosis and calcifications -Lymph node, negative for metastatic carcinoma. Left breast 2 o'clock axis calcifications, core biopsy: -Ductal carcinoma in situ, intermediate to high nuclear grade, solid increased perforated patterns with necrosis and calcifications. - skeletal muscle. Pathology results indicate that the specimen is malignant. The pathology results are concordant with the imaging. Contrast-enhanced breast MRI is recommended</data>
