      <data key="d13">[DOCUMENT: Imaging_External1.pdf] [REDACTED] 11:27 PM Sun, Fengmei (MR # 38307961) Media Information From: Main Street Radiology To: [REDACTED] Page: 1/2 Date: 9/5/2025 4:46:06 PM [LOGO: MAIN STREET RADIOLOGY] Bayside 34th Ave 82-35 Francis Lewis Blvd, Bayside, NY 11358 Bayside 56th Ave 44-01 Francis Lewis Blvd, Bayside, NY 11361 Tel (718) 428-1500 • Fax (718) 428-2472 Downtown Flushing 136-20 37th Ave, Flushing, NY 11354 www.mainstreetradiology.com Northern Queens 77-08 Northern Blvd, Jackson Hts, NY 11372 Glendale 62-14 Cooper Ave, Glendale, NY 11385 :: HUI WEN HUANG, NP :: 135-27 38th Ave, 2nd FL FLUSHING, NY [REDACTED] Referrer Phone: [REDACTED] Name: FENGMEI SUN Pt ID: [REDACTED] Gender: Female DOB: 3/4/1954 Patient [REDACTED] Exam Date: 8/9/2025 10:13 AM Acc #: 10036245 Secondary ID: [REDACTED] Exam Name: [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] Indication: Patient [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] screening. The patient has no [REDACTED] [REDACTED] of breast cancer. The patient [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] Breast Cancer Risk: NCI 5 year:0.6% NCI Lifetime:2.0% Last reported clinical breast exam: Does not remember Comparison: Prior exams dating back to 2019. Technique: Digital tomosynthesis CC and MLO views of both breasts were obtained. Reconstructed C views were also acquired. CAD was utilized.Deep learning algorithms (AI) were applied to mammography images and DBT slices as a concurrent reading aid. Mammography: The breast tissue is heterogeneously dense, which may obscure small masses. There are no [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] Ultrasound: Complete bilateral breast ultrasound including all 4 quadrants, retroareolar regions and the axillae.: Right breast: No [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] [REDACTED] 12:00 4 cm from nipple, a 0.6 cm hypoechoic mass is stable and benign. This fax was sent with GFI FaxMaker fax server. F