s been calculated, the results are based on information provided by the patient. Electronically signed by: Ron Benjamin MD [REDACTED] 11:34 AM Workstation: OUTREAD2 Report Electronically Signed by: Ron Benjamin MD Report Electronically Signed on: [REDACTED] 11:34 AM This fax was sent with GFI FaxMaker fax server. For more information, visit: http://www.gfi.com Document Information Misc Administration: Outside Radiology, Breast US 2/3 Sun, Fengmei (MR # 38307961) Printed by Solange Bayard, MD [REDACTED] at [REDACTED] 11:27 PM [REDACTED] 11:27 PM Sun, Fengmei (MR # 38307961) [REDACTED] 00:00 Attached To: OUTSIDE RADIOLOGY ORDER [REDACTED] Orders Only on [REDACTED] with Historical Provider, [REDACTED] Source Information Rea Kate Toy | Msk Pas Sun, Fengmei (MR # 38307961) Printed by Solange Bayard, MD [REDACTED] at [REDACTED] 11:27 PM 3/3 [DOCUMENT: Imaging_External2.pdf] ■■■■ 11:28 PM Sun, Fengmei (MR # 38307961) Media Information From: Main Street Radiology To: ■■■■■■■■ Page: 1/2 Date: 9/5/2025 4:46:26 PM MAIN STREET RADIOLOGY Bayside: 5444 Ave 32-55 Francis Lewis Blvd, Bayside, NY 11358 Bayside 8446 Ave 44-01 Francis Lewis Blvd, Bayside, NY 11361 Tel (718) 428-1500 • Fax (718) 428-2673 Downtown Flushing 136-25 37th Ave, Flushing, NY 11354 www.mainstreetradiology.com Westorn Queens 37-06 Southern Blvd, Jackson Hts, NY 11372 Glendale 82-14 Cooper Ave, Glendale, NY 11385 :: HUI WEN HUANG, NP :: 135-27 38th Ave, 2nd FL FLUSHING, NY ■■■■■ Referrer Phone: ■■■■■■■■ Name: FENGMEI SUN Phone: ■■■■■■■■ Gender: Female DOB: 3/4/1954 Patient ■■ Exam Date: 8/9/2025 08:44 AM Acc #: 10036244 Secondary ID: ■■■■ Exam Name: ■■■■■■■■■■ ■■■■■■■■■■ ■■■■■■■■■■■■ ■■■■■ Indication: Patient ■■■■ ■■■■■■■■ ■■■■ ■■■■■■■■ screening. The patient has no ■■■■■■■■ ■■■■ of breast cancer. The patient ■■■■■■■■ ■■■■■■■■■■■■ ■■■■■■■■■■■■■■■ Breast Cancer Risk: NCI 5 year:0.6% NCI Lifetime:2.0% Last reported clinical breast exam: Does not remember Comparison: Prior exams dating back to 2019. Technique: Digi